  license, copyright notices and history of ReXGlue are kept unchanged.

Xenia
  https://xenia.jp, https://github.com/xenia-project/xenia
  Copyright (c) 2022, Ben Vanik and Xenia project contributors.
  ReXGlue's runtime and Xenos GPU emulation are derived from Xenia (see LICENSE).
